WEBVTT

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:05.800
In the past, Tokine had been
severely injured

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.600
due to Yoshimori's carelessness.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:13.500
That's why...

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.750
I want to seal the powers
of Karasumori forever.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.910
Because this is the cause of it all.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.540
What?

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.020
Gen Shishio of the Shadow Organization,
Special Forces Night Troops!

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:32.290
Dispatched to provide security
in the land of Karasumori

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.090
and assist the Kekkaishi here.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:39.700
Gen refused to open up his heart
because of his dark past.

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:42.700
I believe in you.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.970
Shut up!

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.700
I need you!

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.020
Amidst that, the mysterious organization,
the Kokuboro.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.640
Started their full frontal attack.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.150
Yoshimori's group suffered
in this difficult battle.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:02.520
Shishio broke the taboo of the Night Troops
and completely transformed

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.550
to defeat Gagin of the Kokuboro.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:07.750
Here's the finishing blow!

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:18.290
Gen fulfilled his mission to
protect Karasumori, with his life.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.570
Shishio! Shishio!

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:24.040
Don't call my name so much.

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.440
I can't sleep...

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:38.730
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.600
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:45.800
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.700
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:51.140
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:55.540
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:59.080
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:02.420
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:08.080
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:12.590
Sha la la la la...

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:19.000
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.970
(Secret romance)

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:26.170
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.940
(A strange distance)

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:34.780
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:35.850
Yeah

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.320
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:42.920
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:48.260
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:15.020
Everything started from within
the darkness of Karasumori.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.240
Aihi, how is the Princess?

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.850
Her condition has stabilized.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.610
But we won't be able to
move her anymore.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:44.550
I think we should reconsider
our plan of making her

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.450
the master of Karasumori.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.350
What about the Princess?
What about this castle?!

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:51.060
In order to deal with that.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.580
We must know more about
the powers of Karasumori.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:58.060
Hekian. I want more detailed information
on Karasumori.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.230
Use the Intelligence Team.

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:01.560
Understood.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.300
By the way,
what about Task Force One?

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.510
It's not functioning now
that Gagin-san is gone.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:13.610
It's worse!
They're just a mob now!

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.870
They do nothing but fight
and destroy the castle.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.850
This is unforgivable!

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:24.950
If we were to attack Karasumori again,
the Night Troops will come for us, right?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.020
I will deal with
the Night Troops.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:32.160
That's fine, but you can't depend
on my Task Force Two all the time.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:37.000
Shion. How about you taking charge
of Task Force One for the time being?

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:41.270
Sounds like a pain.
Get someone else to do it.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:46.570
Let him do it.
That big guy that worked under Gagin.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:48.780
What's his name?

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:50.380
That would be Sakon.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.490
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:00.560
You! Don't think you can
enter here without permission

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.290
and go unpunished!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.820
I am well aware of that.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:09.970
However, there is something
that I, Sakon, must ask of you

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:12.000
even at the risk of my own life.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.000
What is it?

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.580
I would like permission
to command Task Force One

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.100
to attack Karasumori, Byaku-sama.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.540
Oh?

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:26.390
I would like to avenge Gagin-sama.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:32.980
The only way to tame our anger is
to tear the Kekkaishi limb from limb.

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:37.100
Sakon. That is for me to decide.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.260
Not you.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:44.630
I have overstepped my bounds.
Please forgive me.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.080
However. As of now.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:51.010
They are becoming increasingly
unpredictable due to their anger.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:55.210
The head of Task Force One
is supposed to restrain them.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.480
I wish to be appointed.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:02.350
I understand.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.750
I shall be sure to meet
your expectations.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:15.860
Kaguro-san.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:19.160
Hey, Sakon. That sure went well.

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:20.860
What do you mean?

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.740
Now you're an executive
leading Task Force One.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:28.040
I wonder who benefited
the most from Gagin's death.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:32.650
That's a very twisted way
of looking at things.

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.710
Is that a compliment?

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:37.450
Of course.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:38.820
By the way...

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:43.800
I wonder why Gagin didn't allow you
to join the battle at Karasumori?

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:50.130
You were almost as strong as Gagin
and yet you were left behind here.

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.810
Maybe your next move is
to become the commander

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.570
of the Battle Squad on Karasumori.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:57.980
If you can claim Karasumori
and present it to Byaku-sama,

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.880
he will take a liking to you.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.850
And then what?

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:13.190
Stop it. Don't waste your energy.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.220
I have no intention of fighting you.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:21.070
But that kid protecting Karasumori
is mine.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.840
Remember that.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:27.430
That kid is very interesting.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:32.510
It won't be fun to kill him
unless he gets stronger.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.450
Like that kid Shishio.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:42.980
Silent prayer.

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.120
Take him.

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:58.630
Gen!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.910
Gen! Gen!

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.810
Gen!

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.800
He made that mark.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.000
When he first came here.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.630
He was just some brat that
only knew how to fight.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:35.340
He had more strength than
he could manage

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.680
and you taught him everything
from the beginning.

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.980
But he never opened up to
anybody till the very end.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:46.250
Not me, not anybody...
except you and Chief.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.280
Stop it!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:49.780
Stop it...

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:58.050
Gen...

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:04.570
He's so stupid...
Why did he have to die?

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.900
He's dead...

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.500
Even someone as strong as him...

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:14.310
Sen-chan!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:18.380
What's wrong?
You weren't there to say goodbye.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:21.140
Sen-chan.

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:23.380
This is stupid.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:25.950
You know...

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:31.360
He died protecting Karasumori
and the legitimate something.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:33.020
Sen-chan.

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:36.300
I didn't understand him before.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.470
So it's only natural that
I don't understand his death either.

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:40.780
Don't say that about a friend.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:41.940
He's not a friend!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.580
What are you saying?!

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.840
Don't you remember
what he did to Shouki?

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.680
Let's settle this.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:57.790
I am the lead for
the Battle Squad!

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.220
You came in
and just took it from me!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.560
I'm just following orders.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:04.790
Shut up!

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:06.860
All you do is wag your tail
to the superiors!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.470
What are you?!
Chief's pet dog or something?!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.430
Is sucking up to the Chief
that important?!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:20.240
Monster...

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:23.820
You're not human!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:29.760
Once you snap, you kill everything.
You even hurt your own sister!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:32.020
You're a true monster!!

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.660
Shouki-kun was at fault too.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.600
That doesn't give him the right
to almost kill him.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.090
He wasn't normal.

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:49.440
Besides, you guys said that
you couldn't work with him either.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:00.840
Get out of my way.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:21.280
This is bad. That thing is huge.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.340
It'll just wreak havoc
if we make it mad.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.970
We better run.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:28.620
Shishio. We should retreat
and ask the Chief what to do.

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:32.410
I'll finish what the Chief
ordered us to do.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.650
See?! I told you so!
Now he made the Valley Jumper mad!

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:21.600
Shishio! It's all your fault!

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.800
Deputy Chief! We can't take this!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.830
We don't want to be put in danger
because of him anymore!

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:31.440
He always ignores us!

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:36.350
We can't trust him!
He probably doesn't trust us either!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:39.880
I can't work with someone I don't trust.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.550
Please take Shishio off our team!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.420
Where's Gen?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.390
Did you leave him?

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:21.420
Shishio?

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.700
A-Are you...

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.690
I defeated the Valley Jumper.

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.330
You defeated it... Alone?

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.500
What are you, stupid?

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.810
Why do you always
push yourself that far?

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:36.200
I don't get you!

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:39.370
What do you get out of doing this?!

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:41.650
No one would thank you.

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:44.220
Actually, everyone thinks
you're a nuisance!

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:49.220
You rushed in on your own
and put us all in danger.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.750
Can't you see that everyone is mad?!

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:57.030
This is my job.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:01.360
H-Hey!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.840
Your job? You say that so easily...

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:15.580
He seemed so far away...
I couldn't say anything...

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:17.310
Hey...

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.680
Wh-What?

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.020
You liked him, didn't you?

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:25.630
D-Don't be stupid!
Do you want me to beat you up?!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:29.620
But you've just been talking
nonstop about him.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.860
I hate him!

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.870
I hate him...

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.210
Let's go, Yoshimori.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.590
Bro, maybe Tokine should come too.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:58.490
No. We shouldn't even
be going in the first place.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.090
Sumimura-san.

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:13.570
I'm very sorry but...

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:14.560
Please leave!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:19.970
Why did you come?!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:23.440
Ryo, go over there for a minute.

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:24.980
Dad, you be quiet!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.790
I'm extremely sorry about...

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:29.690
I don't want to hear anything from you!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.080
Please leave!

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:33.750
Then at least accept this.

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:35.180
No thank you.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.460
We will not accept anything from you!

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.770
If I knew your organization was
so dangerous

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:40.940
that a 14-year-old kid could be killed,

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.990
I would never have let you
take Gen!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.800
I hear people like him are born
in our family from time to time.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.440
I already talked to
your mother about it,

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:52.740
but there is a special organization
that will take in people like him.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:54.840
You're right.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.750
Damn it! Damn it!
Damn it! Why?!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.820
It's okay. Your Big Sister will
always be here to protect you.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.490
Big Sister...

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:10.800
You said you were going to protect me!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.320
Wait!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:21.900
Big Sister.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:28.640
Please leave.

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:31.710
I understand.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:35.140
But I must return these to you.

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:38.150
My letters.

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:43.990
I held onto them because your brother
said that he couldn't accept them yet.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:49.560
I intended on giving them to him
when he was ready...

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:51.690
Ryo...

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:53.800
This is terrible.

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:58.170
None of my words reached him!

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:02.510
I betrayed him once.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:06.580
I let go of his hand when
he needed me the most.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:10.080
That's why...

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:16.090
I wanted to apologize to him.
I wanted to apologize to him!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:21.000
Please leave.

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:24.930
I know we asked you to
take care of him, but... I'm sorry.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.030
Not at all...
We apologize for disturbing you.

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.050
Let's go, Yoshimori.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:40.840
Um...

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:47.790
He said that he wanted
to apologize to you.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:53.960
I owed him a lot.
But I couldn't do anything...

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:58.760
But he still smiled like he wanted me
to stop worrying about him.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.810
I'm really sorry!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.070
Wait!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:08.010
Are you... Gen's friend?

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:09.440
Yes!

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:26.970
Why did he have such
a satisfied look on his face?

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.500
Gen needed a mission to live.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:32.310
He broke the taboo of the Night Troops,

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:35.330
but he still fulfilled his mission...
at the cost of his life.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:38.650
So he lived up to your expectations.

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:42.010
Yeah. And now it's our turn
to live up to his.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:52.550
The moon looks wonderful over
your garden tonight.

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:56.860
Yes. Do you see the blooming red orchids
next to the water fountain?

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.490
You are fortunate to see that.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:03.030
Last time I visited.
They were still buds.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:05.390
They require careful cultivation.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.370
I have never seen such beautiful flowers.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:11.900
They also represent
separation by death...

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:15.810
Those who see them are
said to perish soon.

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:17.780
Did you know that?

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:19.540
I did not.

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:21.850
The plants in a garden are nice.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:25.620
The more you care for them,
the more beautiful they bloom.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.450
They never show themselves
in an unsightly manner.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:31.860
"Unsightly manner"...
That is a very harsh evaluation.

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.400
I have no choice...

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:40.740
I delayed the Night Troops for you and
all you did was kill some Half-Ayakashi kid.

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:43.980
We retreated due to
our master's circumstances.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.770
We did not lose in battle.

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:49.350
Sounds like an excuse.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:54.350
A few unexpected occurrences
could be entertaining, don't you think?

00:19:55.820 --> 00:20:00.780
I see... But the next failure
will not be entertaining.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:06.020
Then would you restrain
the Night Troops once more?

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:11.730
Very well... I feel no reluctance
interfering with that man.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:24.740
You know... You should have let
Shigemori take your place tonight.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:25.880
No.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:30.680
I know how you feel,
but some things are beyond our control.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:31.950
That's not it.

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:37.030
He said he was content before he died.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.330
That's a good thing.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:40.970
At that moment...

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:45.970
I felt his life escape his body...

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.940
That was Karasumori helping him, right?

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:53.780
He wanted to die
so Karasumori helped him.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:57.450
I couldn't make him want to live!

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.280
Even though I was his friend.

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:04.210
Yoshimori!

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:06.520
Shut up! Don't come here!

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.020
I told you to stay away!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.770
Dummy. I'm used to seeing you cry.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.670
Did you go to the funeral?

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:23.410
Yeah. But they chased us out.

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.440
Shishio is so stupid...

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.320
He didn't have to risk his life
for Karasumori.

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:36.120
I don't think he did it for Karasumori.

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:37.550
What?

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:39.380
I don't really know, but...

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.590
He was a good person.

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:44.790
Don't say it.

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:49.470
Go ahead and cry.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.770
I'm not going to make fun of you.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.700
No. You're going to tease me later.

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:56.800
I won't.

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:59.710
I would never do that.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:05.740
He's still holding it in.

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:09.110
I wanted to cry with him.

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:17.060
If I cry now, Tokine would
probably comfort me.

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:19.020
But that's not good!

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:22.390
I won't cry anymore!

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:24.960
I am going to get stronger,
so I'll never have to cry anymore.

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:27.100
Yeah...

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:45.830
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:52.530
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.100 --> 00:23:01.910
Joking around, I noticed after I laughed

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:08.250
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.180 --> 00:23:18.090
You don't have to say anything, it's okay

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:24.460
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:33.540
Straight ahead, I'm pushing forward

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:41.070
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:42.820 --> 00:23:50.060
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.060 --> 00:23:58.620
The red string connects one to another
